WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:07.980
You learned early [that] you know you wanted to avoid confrontation, so you went behind the screen.

2
00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:13.720
They had so many seats allocated for Afro-Americans, we normally just went on behind the screen.

3
00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:19.020
But if the bus got crowded with whites, blacks had to get up . . .

4
00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:25.260
And during the bus boycott it was a tremendous sacrifice for me because I was married,

5
00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:34.220
I was working on Terrace and Highland Road, so bus transportation was the only transportation that I had at that time.

6
00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:38.027
But we gave it up, my wife and I. We gave it up to try to make the bus boycott work.
